            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Dictionaries provide a <strong>fast and efficient</strong> way to work with <strong>structured data</strong>. In this exercise, we looked at ways of creating dictionaries, how to update them, and how to extract their attributes. Remember to look into the Python documentation to learn more about these data structures!</span></span>"
